WEBVTT

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.400
Go for it, big brother!

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.540
We did it!

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.990
Big brother, you're so cool!

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:00.500
There are no customers coming in...

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.810
Can't help it 'cause there's a recession.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.270
Yeah, I hate recessions.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.730
Yeah, me too.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.250
Doremi-chan, do you know what recession means?

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:12.440
Of course I know.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.980
It means that people don't have any dough for their cakes, right?

00:02:19.610 --> 00:02:21.500
Anybody here?

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:22.910
We have a customer.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.510
W-Wel...

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:25.460
...come!

00:02:39.520 --> 00:02:41.490
A Wish for a Precious Shirt.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.380
Excuse me, what are you looking for?

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.480
That's...

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.360
A flyer that we distributed, right?

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.520
Is it true?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.480
Will my wishes really come true?

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:02.450
They might... Then again they might not...

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.660
So, which is it?

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:11.580
Basically we wish for them to come true, but we can't really guarantee that they will, so...

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.090
It's kinda hard to understand...

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:17.050
I'll take this.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:19.760
I want this soccer ball pendant.

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.720
That's not a ball, it's a panda.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.220
It's a soccer ball no matter how you look at it.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.250
Thank you very much.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.750
I'm telling you, it's a panda.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.950
Well, as long as it sells.

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.940
Your total is 280 yen.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.400
280 yen?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.360
Yes.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.320
I don't have it.

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.740
I don't have any money, so I'll trade you my treasure.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:50.290
So, you're saying that you traded it for this dirty little shirt!?

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:54.010
In short, I guess that's what happened.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:56.110
Actually, we couldn't help it.

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:57.000
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.720
He just threw it off and then bolted.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.920
Right?

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:07.130
Oh well... While it won't bring in any money, we can probably trade it for some magic spheres.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.390
Even something like this should bring in at least one magic sphere.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:13.750
What? It doesn't always have to be money?

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:46.370
~ Hello! I bring you magic spheres. ~

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:50.440
~ I, Dela, have arrived! ~

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.980
Dela, you've come at a good time.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:05:06.240
~ Do you need to place an additional order? ~

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:09.660
Please check how much this shirt is worth in the Witch World.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:13.700
~ That's easy. ~

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:23.590
Place the shirt on this side and magic spheres on the other side.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.870
Amazing! It's worth 20 magic spheres.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:33.850
Sold!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:35.630
~ Thanks a lot. ~

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:37.270
Please wait!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:38.720
What is it, Doremi?

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:42.220
Why is such a shirt worth so much?

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:43.350
Yeah, yeah.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:45.720
What? Don't you even know that?

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:46.700
Explain to them.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.910
It's like a premium on certain things.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.410
Premium?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.370
In the Witch World, regular items or money don't matter.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:58.290
The stronger the owner's attachment to it, the higher its worth.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.790
Oh, is that so?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:04.760
Which means the owner is very strongly attached to this shirt.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:06.730
Very attached...

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:27.640
It's about time I take my leave.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.870
So what is it? Are you selling it or not?

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.040
Of course...

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:40.830
Not!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:45.800
Jeez! We finally have a chance to make money and...

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.620
I wonder what his wish is.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:59.090
It's a wish worth 20 magic spheres!

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:01.690
I'm a bit curious.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:10.490
Dodo, what's wrong?

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.520
What's this?

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:15.880
What is it, Ai-chan?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.580
Look at this. On the collar.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.470
Could it be a name?

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:21.540
Let me see.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.200
It's the same in my family, so I know.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:29.410
In other words, this is...

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:31.090
A hand-me-down from a sibling.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:40.680
Darn it!

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.850
Big brother!

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:48.230
Misaki, where's the shirt you always wear?

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.950
Ah, somewhere.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.200
More importantly big bro, this is for you.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.650
What's that?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:57.620
A magic pendant! It'll help you grant your wish.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.170
My wish?

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:03.120
Yeah! If you wear this, you'll be able to play in the next game for sure.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.100
If you're in the game, be sure to score a goal.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:10.760
Pipe down.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:13.760
If you wear the pendant, you'll be able to do it for sure.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.540
I'm home.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.100
Pop's party?

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:28.280
By the way, Misaki-kun, what happened to that soccer shirt you're always wearing?

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.280
Soccer shirt?

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.740
Though I must say I prefer what you're wearing now.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.560
I traded it for something.

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:35.490
Traded it?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:36.460
For what?

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:39.240
For a soccer ball pendant.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.750
It's a panda, alright?

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.780
A pendant?

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:43.660
Yep!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:47.070
It that alright? You cherished that shirt so much.

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:47.710
It's alright.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:53.170
Because thanks to that pendant, my brother will be able to play in the next match.

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:54.380
Match?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:00.350
So your brother is a reserve?

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:08.270
We thought he was a regular player because you're so proud of him.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.270
What? He's only a reserve, huh?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.240
Don't laugh at my brother!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.240
But he's only a reserve.

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.700
My brother is really great when he can play!

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.470
He's just not had a chance to play in a match yet!

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:24.460
He'd destroy the other team if he had the chance!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.000
He's promised me that he'd score a goal!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.210
But he's still only a reserve.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:32.170
Stop that everyone.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:33.920
I'm going home!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.130
Misaki-kun!

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.800
Is that how it is?

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.830
So Misaki-kun's wish...

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.640
...is that his brother could play in the match, huh?

00:09:57.460 --> 00:09:59.810
I wish that he could, but...

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.330
At this rate...

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.480
Daichi, get a hold of yourself!

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.160
R-Right!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.950
He fell again.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.670
What are we going to do?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:13.090
I don't think that we can do anything about this...

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:17.980
Yeah. It's no use worryin'. The decision is up to the coach after all...

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.950
But Misaki-kun truly believes that his brother will be in the game.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.320
Are you taking this seriously at all!?

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.720
That was Misaki-kun just now.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:05.770
Why was he in such a hurry?

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:06.930
Maybe he's lookin' fer his bro.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.430
Let's check it out.

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:18.700
Big brother!

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:20.820
W-What is it?

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:25.700
The date... for the game... has been decided, hasn't it?

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.710
You'll be in the game this time for sure.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.710
Because you're wearing the magic pendant.

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:35.170
I'll come to see you for sure.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.130
Stop dreaming.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.940
I told you to stop dreaming.

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:45.050
But you practice so hard here every day.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:46.860
And you love soccer so much.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:51.520
Listen, Misaki. You don't get to play in the game if you're not good.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:54.410
But you play so good!

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.390
I don't play well at all.

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:01.450
I won't be able to play in the game.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.010
You don't know that!

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:04.990
I just know!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:05.910
You don't!

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:06.990
Do too!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.680
It'll be all right if you're wearing the magic pendant.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.420
You think I can participate in the game with something like this!?

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.980
Leave me alone already!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:22.760
Don't come to the game, either!

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.390
Oh no! They're fightin'.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.720
That's so mean. He didn't have to say that.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.760
Poor Misaki-kun.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.540
You're in my way, go away.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:37.520
I'm not going to the game even if you beg me!

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:41.120
You're such an idiot, big brother!

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:47.830
We have to get him in the game no matter what.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:51.550
But he plays so bad that I dunno if we can help him.

00:12:51.550 --> 00:12:52.950
Even so...

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:55.520
That's right, we can't leave Misaki-kun alone.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:56.720
I guess...

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.210
He's our customer after all.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.170
Then let's do it, shall we?

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:16.440
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:31.830
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:47.000
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.040
So, what do we do now?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.170
What do we do!? Now look here...

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.430
I think we should use Magical Stage.

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:58.440
Yeah! It'll work out fine if we all combine our strength.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.690
Okay, let's go!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.460
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.360
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.600
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.270
Magical Stage!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:27.590
Get Daichi-kun in the soccer game!

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:35.470
Woof woof?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:38.110
Only the barking of the dog?

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:39.370
Did we fail?

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:49.150
Nothing seems to be happening.

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.620
Did we really fail?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.950
In that case, we'll have to think of somethin' else.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:00.670
Igarashi-sempai is always so handsome whenever I see him.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:03.460
This ain't the time fer that.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:08.170
This is... Is that what was causing the barking?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:09.950
Either way, we can't ignore it.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:10.990
Let's follow 'em!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:18.520
We're done for!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:25.280
Thank goodness, everyone looks alright.

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:27.820
What's gotten into them?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.260
I think they've stopped chasing us.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.540
I thought we were goners.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.030
Hey, that's...

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.570
It's Daichi.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.750
What's he doing way out here?

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.220
Practicing.

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:49.210
He's practicing alone.

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:52.180
No way! That Daichi?

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:55.060
Does he look like he's playing around?

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:55.640
No.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.020
Coach!

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:15.820
What is it?

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:17.280
There's something we need to talk about.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.920
What was goin' on with those dogs anyway?

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:21.920
Maybe we failed.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:24.540
Well, castin' that magic was a long shot anyway.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.250
What is it, Doremi-chan?

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:30.880
I'm just glad that Igarashi-sempai is alright.

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:35.680
Of course, I don't just mean Igarashi-sempai.

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:39.640
Okay? Relax and do your best in the game as usual.

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.370
You understand?

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.210
Yes, sir!

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.180
Alright! Get going!

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.190
Yeah!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:47.090
I was hopin' fer a miracle...

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:49.450
But it look like his brother is still a reserve.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.440
Maybe we're just incompetent.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:54.780
Daichi, come over here.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:57.870
What is it?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.160
Warm up.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.740
You'll be up in the next half.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.440
You'll be up in the next half.

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:04.120
What do you say?

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.000
Yes, sir!

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.040
Hey! Look.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.470
What's he doing?

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:19.750
I know!

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:21.770
Know what?

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.680
The magic worked!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:28.290
He's stretchin' there, which means that he's gonna play, right?

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:28.860
I see.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.360
Oh no! We gotta tell Misaki-kun!

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.560
But where could he be?

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:37.820
I mean, where is Misaki-kun's house?

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.870
We couldn't possibly know that.

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.640
But we gotta find him.

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.040
Let's split up and search for him.

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:45.050
Okay, see you later then.

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:06.330
Any luck?

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:09.400
No, he wasn't home or at any of his friend's places.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:10.400
Hadzuki-chan?

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:11.150
I couldn't find him.

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:13.610
Half-time!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:17.360
How about that place? That field where his brother always practices.

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:18.270
Oh yeah!

00:18:18.270 --> 00:18:19.700
Let's check it out.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:31.620
You're great, big brother!

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.390
You can have this shirt.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:35.560
Eh? Really?

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.720
You're going to start playing soccer someday anyway, right?

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.830
In that case, wear this.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:42.830
Someday, we'll get into the Japanese soccer league together...

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:45.860
No! Let's even be the Japanese representatives abroad! Okay?

00:18:45.860 --> 00:18:46.800
Yep!

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:50.900
But before that, I'll have to become a regular player at school.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.890
It's alright. Promise me you'll do it, big brother!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.160
Didn't you promise?

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.790
You're an idiot.

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:06.000
Like we thought, there he is!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.950
Wait, Doremi-chan!

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.610
Misaki-kun.

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:12.420
Who... Who are you? How did you fly down from the sky?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:16.210
Oh no! I forgot and flew down directly.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.840
In that case...

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.760
I-I'm the genie of the pendant.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.500
I don't have time to explain.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:25.370
Misaki-kun, get on quickly.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:26.670
Get on what?

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:26.970
This.

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.940
No! I don't want to ride on that.

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:33.400
Your brother is in the game. Misaki-kun, don't you want to see him?

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.360
The game?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.790
And it's already the second half.

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.660
Hold on tight.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.200
Is he... Is he really in the game?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:49.660
Yeah. And he worked really hard for you, Misaki-kun.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:53.130
Then... You're really the genie of the pendant?

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.400
Don't tell anyone.

00:19:55.400 --> 00:19:56.320
Okay.

00:19:57.790 --> 00:19:59.010
Free kick!

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:01.470
We're almost out of time.

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.940
This is our last chance.

00:20:02.940 --> 00:20:03.710
Daichi.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.010
Yes?

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:05.970
You're up.

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.150
M-Me?

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:08.890
B-But...

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:11.960
Aren't you always practicing alone?

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:16.360
Big brother!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.320
Good luck!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.780
Misaki?

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:22.240
Turn the tables with just one kick.

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.390
He did it! He did it! He did it!

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:52.640
I did it!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.440
Game over!

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:06.980
Big brother!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:12.960
Misaki, thank you.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:19.250
Thanks to this... No, thanks to you, I could score a goal.

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.050
Big brother!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:20.860
Hey, hey.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.030
Misaki-kun.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.300
It's you girls.

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:28.460
Things worked out great, right, Misaki-kun?

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:28.840
Yep.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:30.260
I'll give this back to you.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.350
That shirt is...

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:33.770
But...

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.870
It's alright.

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:39.440
You'll have to become a soccer player as cool as your brother.

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.400
Okay!

00:21:40.400 --> 00:21:43.860
Cool? I'm not...

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:47.430
See you!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.950
Thank you, girls!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.090
I'll become a player as great as my brother.

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:55.490
Misaki, stop that! You're embarrassing me.

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:57.790
I'll become a great player.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.510
Wait, Misaki!

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:04.190
What's with this level 8 witch exam!?

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:07.310
They said that there are ten legs on its head.

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:09.450
Ten legs? I don't get it.

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:10.610
I wonder if it's French?

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:11.540
Ten legs...

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:14.690
I wonder... Wouldn't eight legs be better?

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:15.720
Eight legs?

00:22:16.090 --> 00:22:20.310
Ahhh! I don't understand! At this rate I'm going to fail again.

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:22.900
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:25.550
Everyone Fails!? The Level 8 Exam.

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:28.650
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
